      "uid": "zhcn:7db4b4b9ec28aaec93cfd7eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时，跑输的小栗帽表示──\n希望“天皇赏（秋）”结束后能接着在“日本杯”\n和“有马纪念”中对决，挑战GⅠ三连战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60ee086480f4107cb90dbead052d0967979ee7398f871d33397cc3140950d2df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
