    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0315022282fe03eb7629918a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是“有马纪念”。\n玉藻十字和训练员多了一个\n是否要参加“日本杯”的考量选择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91275955bec3a873ca113e9b2211bae3d2e08fa1d31eeefb763e0ed2848f0dd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
