      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到小栗帽的邀约，\n参加了GⅠ三连战的第二战“日本杯”，\n并成功拿下胜利的玉藻十字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c3acf5654d848b298de2e64a09cd5595890fd2a6e3006589e5fc415f1fe4309",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1021/storytimeline_501021432.json",
      "json_path": [
