      "uid": "zhcn:8ad04d76f74ddfd4137cc3c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但却是耗尽了身体的极限，如履薄冰的胜利……\n她一边祈祷身体能承受得住，\n一边朝“有马纪念”前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34659481a71ddd887ad4a6527ade93cd885d773d3bbe3d492ae0a420e62398e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
